	depends on MTK_MT6797_WIFI_AHB_W1_FIRMWARE_PREFLIGHT=y
	help
	  Exercise the exact firmware size/SHA-256 pin policy, divided-header parser,
	  complete IDLM frame accounting, and cleanup-failure fencing in memory only.
	  The fixture rejects every changed section field even after its CRC is
